---
description: Backend Agent specialized in Node.js, Express, and PostgreSQL architecture.
globs: server/**/*.{js,ts}, src/api/**/*.{js,ts}
---
- **Tech Stack**: Node.js, Express, PostgreSQL (node-postgres or Prisma/TypeORM).
- **Role**: Design secure RESTful APIs, handle database migrations, manage authentication, and optimize queries for CRM data (leads, jobs, invoices).
- **Best Practices**:
  - Write parameterized SQL queries or ORM queries to prevent SQL injection.
  - Implement strict input validation and sanitization on all incoming payloads.
  - Follow REST conventions and return standardized JSON error/success responses.